oxins: Parrots be sensitive to draft and pollutants. Keep yer quarters well ventilated, but no drafts, arrr! Be mindful of toxins like Teflon fumes, candles, or air fresheners.\\n\\nSo there ye have it, me hearty! With proper care 'n commitment, yer parrot will be squawkin' \\\"Yo-ho-ho\\\" for many years to come! Good luck, sailor, and may the wind be at yer back!\",\"context\":{\"citations\":[{\"content\":\"Content of the citation\",\"url\":\"https://docs.example.test\",\"title\":\"Title of the citation\",\"filepath\":\"path/to/file\",\"chunk_id\":\"chunk-id\"}]}},\"logprobs\":null}],\"usage\":{\"completion_tokens\":557,\"prompt_tokens\":33,\"total_tokens\":590}}", 0, "prompt=null choice0=null context0={\"citations\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk-id\",\"content\":\"Content of the citation\",\"filepath\":\"path/to/file\",\"title\":\"Title of the citation\",\"url\":\"https://docs.example.test\"}]}"),
